"""Opening-bracket detector for layers.0.mlp.down_proj:2656.

This component signals "an opening bracket or quote starts here". It is strongest on a
space-prefixed open parenthesis " (" (a function call or an aside). It is stronger after a
word (a function name or keyword, as in "print (" or "if (") than after an operator or
punctuation (as in "= (" or ", ("). It is weaker, about 0.6, on the other tokens that open
a quoted or bracketed span: a space-prefixed double quote, single quote, square bracket,
angle bracket, brace or backtick, and a double underscore. A bare "(" with no space does
not fire. Everything else is about 0.
