Strongest on 装/裝 and 'assembly'; weaker on packaging, clothing,
installation, decoration, containers and encoding. 'Static' is negative.
This matches spellings, not contextual senses: legislative Assembly
also fires. 'Of' following assembly/installation and 'set up' retain
some signal. Other tokens predict zero; state resets at documents.
